      "message": "Please explain why the skip should be specific to chip/model. There\u0027s a similar non-specific skip in https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:cts/tests/tests/keystore/src/android/keystore/cts/AttestKeyTest.java;l\u003d203.\nDon\u0027t you think that both should be specific, or both non-specific?\nI think the latter is better, so we won\u0027t have to make fixes for every new chip/model.",
